# CQ13: Which instruments sit at Aspen stage 5 of E100?
PREFIX ccpp: <http://imperial.ac.uk/ccpp#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?tag ?var ?phase WHERE {
  ?i ccpp:locatedAtStage ?s ; ccpp:tag ?tag ; ccpp:measuredVariable ?var .
  ?s ccpp:stageNumber 5 .
  OPTIONAL { ?i ccpp:measuredPhase ?phase }
} ORDER BY ?tag
